  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Out on the dark highway in Hokkaido, Toshi and Kawada roll right up to a nighttime police checkpoint. Toshi panics when an officer asks to inspect the cargo bed, but calm Kawada has prepared a clever surprise inside children's picture books. Listen to the polite checkpoint questions first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "検問ですよね、あれ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "まずいだろ、これ。どうするんだよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "こんばんは。エンジン止めてください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "お酒、飲んでないですね？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "荷台を調べるんで、開けてもらえますか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "もっとちゃんと見てください、お巡りさん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "これ、絵本ですよね？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "確かに絵本だな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "なかなかかわいい絵本ですね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "異常なし。行っていいぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "それじゃ、行きましょうか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "万が一のために積んでおきました。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Watch how the officer shifts from crisp traffic-stop politeness to a gruff wave-through, while Kawada never loses his cool. Let's hear the key lines.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "検問ですよね、あれ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is a checkpoint, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "まずいだろ、これ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is bad.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "こんばんは。エンジン止めてください。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Good evening. Please stop the engine.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "お酒、飲んでないですね？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You have not been drinking alcohol, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "荷台を調べるんで、開けてもらえますか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We are checking the cargo bed, so could you open it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "もっとちゃんと見てください、お巡りさん。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please look more closely, officer.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "これ、絵本ですよね？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'These are picture books, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "確かに絵本だな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They certainly are picture books.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "police",
      "t": "異常なし。行っていいぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nothing unusual. You may go.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "それじゃ、行きましょうか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well then, shall we get going?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "万が一のために積んでおきました。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I loaded them aboard just in case.'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
